Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.62,0:00:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take\Nin the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.94,0:00:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.84,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.62,0:00:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sails all unfurled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.80,0:00:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.04,0:00:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah yeah yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.70,0:00:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.42,0:00:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready now for adventure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.28,0:00:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're itching to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.92,0:00:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Get ready to roam!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.52,0:00:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,So all aboard now we're set to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Set sail to the ocean so deep!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.08,0:00:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready for a truly grand adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.32,0:00:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Well don't you think\Nthat sounds really fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,All this excitement is second to none!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.20,0:00:49.90,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.98,0:00:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Raising our voices we take.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.06,0:00:54.22,Default,,0,0,0,,In the beautiful blue world.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.30,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our spirits ready to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.18,0:00:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.92,0:01:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's go get the sales all unfurled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.34,0:01:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,La la la la la.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.40,0:01:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.02,0:01:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If there's something that\NI just won't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.68,0:01:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the way that I felt\Nwhen our journey was set.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.26,0:01:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I won't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.86,0:01:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I keep that feeling there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.22,0:01:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,With that, let us keep up the pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:26.96,Default,,0,0,0,,While enjoying every\Ntrip from place to place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.04,0:01:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Our timid hearts get the rhythm ingrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.12,0:01:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's keep going, adventure awaits!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.58,0:01:35.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures await!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.88,0:01:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.40,0:01:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.72,0:01:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in\Nhand, everybody rejoices!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.28,0:01:46.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Party on, cause we stand tall and proud!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous, be\Naware it's dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou, now fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.24,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.22,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.16,0:02:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Our master's orders are absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.18,0:02:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We zombies couldn't oppose\Nthem even if we tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.14,0:02:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But that doesn't affect him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.78,0:02:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What makes him different?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.64,0:02:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And wait, why is he as\Nstrong as a general?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:47.68,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is one that\Nis not bound by logic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.76,0:02:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It makes the impossible possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,This unstoppable force that rages like\Na hurricane is none other than love.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not exactly sure how this works!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.86,0:03:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But if he's saying stupid things\Nlike that, that must be Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.10,0:03:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.01,0:03:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Sanji, is that really you in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.42,0:03:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Or maybe you're just friends with Sanji?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.88,0:03:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Either way, he's our friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.26,0:03:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Show your trap, you damn dirty pirate!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:17.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.84,0:03:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess that means we're\Nstill his enemy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:24.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.40,0:03:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know, but it sounds bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.80,0:03:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Haven't we suffered enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.72,0:03:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A one hug in a wedding dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.54,0:03:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen to your commander, Lola!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.44,0:03:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Catch me if you can, you little cutie!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.42,0:03:51.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You wicked cat burglar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.28,0:03:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for stealing Master Ab's\Ngreatest treasure! Me? Treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, I know I'm a pirate and all,\Nbut I haven't stolen anything yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:04.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You stole his heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm going to tear\Nyours out of your chest!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.36,0:04:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't lay a hand on this lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.20,0:04:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.62,0:04:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,And get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.08,0:04:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogwin! Pin! Dog!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That looks bad! Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.76,0:04:31.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't he try to fight back?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I already told you,\NI'll never kick a woman!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.84,0:04:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome speech!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.76,0:04:43.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Guys, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.48,0:04:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be taking my bride, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.06,0:04:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you can fly!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.08,0:04:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Some idiots. I'm being abducted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.44,0:04:57.54,Default,,0,0,0,,here huh by who hey come back we'll
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.62,0:05:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,hold the wedding ceremony\Nimmediately all the preparations have
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,already been made you're that\Ninvisible pervert from the shower
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.38,0:05:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,aren't you let me go whoa i guess\Nit really is invisible huh mommy
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,i was sizing you up in short i've\Ndetermined that you're fit to be my bride
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.42,0:05:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You may call me Absalom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.58,0:05:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the name of your future\Nhusband, so remember it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.88,0:05:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't keep myself in shape so\Nsome sick boy who can drool over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.98,0:05:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,So don't treat me like a\Npiece of meat, you animal!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Thunder Charge!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,NAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.56,0:05:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,NAMI!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.26,0:05:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Great job!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.28,0:05:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Now keep running!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.56,0:05:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta get out of this forest!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.94,0:05:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.12,0:06:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even after that, he's still standing up?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.18,0:06:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is not normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.70,0:06:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Just look at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.28,0:06:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this feeling?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.08,0:06:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Every nerve in my body is dancing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.94,0:06:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.64,0:06:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I can feel it coursing through my veins,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.16,0:06:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,As if I've been struck\Nby lightning, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.86,0:06:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,there can be only one\Nanswer this must be love!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.48,0:06:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,you're not getting away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.00,0:06:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,we gotta stop staring and start moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,even if absalom's here it's\Nstill our job to catch them!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.62,0:06:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you're right and if we fail\Nperola's going to punish us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Not good at this rate,\Nthey're going to hurt her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.94,0:06:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know why it is, but I feel like I\Nhave to protect that lady no matter what!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.80,0:06:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,why is this body so weak!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.10,0:06:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,i can't even take a single step!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.26,0:06:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,i tell it you guys we gotta catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.10,0:06:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,stop and heed my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.86,0:07:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,wild zombies the woman is mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.96,0:07:02.82,Default,,0,0,0,,don't harm her!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,shut up! screw you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,perhaps You can't boss us around.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.80,0:07:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,We only answer to Mistress Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.66,0:07:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,This is out of your jurisdiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.02,0:07:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.18,0:07:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I know you're under Perona's command.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you have the sense to fear her,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.96,0:07:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,you should know how\Nfrightful I can be as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.20,0:07:30.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, mind your\Ntongue when you speak to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.80,0:07:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell do you want? I\Nwon't let you touch that lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.40,0:07:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey newbie, cut it out, man!\NAbsarolm's mad enough already!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.02,0:07:58.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:07:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Cat burglar!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nubby!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.86,0:08:04.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she's only chasing after you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.01,0:08:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.94,0:08:09.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can just sort of split up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.86,0:08:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you selling me out,\Nyou heartless bastard?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.18,0:08:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Get back here and die already!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.48,0:08:18.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Women are scary!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.14,0:08:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll have to run faster than that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:28.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you, but the\Nanswer spoke to them!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.80,0:08:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.68,0:08:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,You captured our crewmates, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.08,0:08:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And carried them behind\Nthat wall like a Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.36,0:08:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.50,0:08:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, ah, ah, ah, ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.90,0:08:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And just wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Because any second now, you'll\Nbe suffering the same fate!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.46,0:08:55.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie generals in the front!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.54,0:08:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Zombie generals behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.78,0:08:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd give up if I were you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.86,0:09:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Whether you're a dumbass\Nmonkey or a dumbass spider,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.72,0:09:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,it looks like that big sticky web that\Ncaught the sunny when we came here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.86,0:09:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,was your work, if I'm not mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.20,0:09:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, you were\Nafter us from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.66,0:09:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Perona's ghost network\Nsees all, knows all, and tells all.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.36,0:09:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Frankly, you were doomed from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.30,0:09:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Those big ears of yours must be\Nuseful for gathering information, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.50,0:09:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,And you certainly like to run your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.48,0:09:27.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Um, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.58,0:09:28.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, what was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.10,0:09:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean they're just for show?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We're completely surrounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.34,0:09:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Worst case scenario, they call it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What we need is a\Nlast-second miracle plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.46,0:09:45.32,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah you think I can handle it I'd love to
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.40,0:09:49.16,Default,,0,0,0,,see you try put on a good show for me you
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.24,0:09:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,got it just follow my\Nlead Check this one out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.06,0:09:54.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! Don't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.72,0:09:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.54,0:09:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.06,0:10:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.52,0:10:04.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't break the friggin' bridge, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's cheating!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.20,0:10:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.11,0:10:11.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My plan's super enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.98,0:10:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, it certainly is violent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.18,0:10:22.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Saul Fluke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.58,0:10:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Whee!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.86,0:10:30.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.77,0:10:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,you can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.40,0:10:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, for five seconds. Flame!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.78,0:10:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,But actually, that's all we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.44,0:10:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Strong right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.08,0:10:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.02,0:10:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I got the ledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.28,0:10:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the building where\Nthey took Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.56,0:10:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,If we can make it up\Nthere, we can save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.86,0:10:53.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't hold it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm returned!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.82,0:11:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A fall like that won't stop a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.86,0:11:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,But at least they're trapped\Nin the courtyard for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.16,0:11:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That should buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.54,0:11:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent work, Franky.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.98,0:11:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.90,0:11:34.61,Default,,0,0,0,,How generous of you to pay a\Ncompliment to your stepping stone!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.04,0:11:36.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You are gonna pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.98,0:11:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You realize I'm a spider, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.64,0:11:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me two seconds and I'll be right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.06,0:11:45.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.97,0:11:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.98,0:11:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like something's falling up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.18,0:11:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,No, someone has fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.24,0:11:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you call a flying skeleton?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.74,0:12:03.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what your\Ndeal is, and I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.50,0:12:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's our friend, and I\Nwon't let you hurt her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.36,0:12:06.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.34,0:12:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't stop punching her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.68,0:12:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,You stop running.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:10.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away, Nami. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.88,0:12:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,The only woman Absalom\Nhas loved to marry is me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.18,0:12:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Get off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.76,0:12:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.67,0:12:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Prepare to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.40,0:12:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.62,0:12:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got it all wrong! I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.08,0:12:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is, I'm a man!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.24,0:12:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.32,0:12:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.23,0:12:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.54,0:12:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, cross-dressing is just a\Nhobby of mine. I'm not joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.04,0:12:50.44,Default,,0,0,0,,And, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.52,0:12:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you and that ab guy make a super
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.56,0:12:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,cute couple You two\Nshould totally hook it up,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.16,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,girlfriend What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.08,0:12:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.99,0:12:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You were made for each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,To be completely honest, I\Nwas beginning to lose hope!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.22,0:13:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,All this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.38,0:13:10.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever offered me a\Nsingle word of encouragement.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.10,0:13:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't know how much it means.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.32,0:13:17.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Raise your head up high, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.44,0:13:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to thank\Nme for saying that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.92,0:13:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.98,0:13:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is Nami, but you can call me Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.64,0:13:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.58,0:13:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.42,0:13:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She bought that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.70,0:13:33.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.80,0:13:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.10,0:13:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put it this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to get married, you\Ncan't do it while he's awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.56,0:13:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.72,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You knock him out and get him\Nto sign while he's sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that really ethical?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.26,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, like, as a human being?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Lola, sweetie, you're a zombie.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.56,0:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A loophole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.68,0:13:50.48,Default,,0,0,0,,A rotting zombie loophole!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:54.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember, if you can't knock him\Nout, you can always drug him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami, weren't we gonna run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.42,0:13:58.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, by the way, Lola,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.06,0:14:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I dropped something important back\Nwhen I visited the treasure vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.54,0:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to go pick it up,\Nbut I don't remember the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you give me directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.42,0:14:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.33,0:14:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You big silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.42,0:14:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go through Mistress Perona's room.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.10,0:14:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's right next door.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't miss it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.44,0:14:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Nami, that warthog bought\Nthat hook, line, and sinker.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.56,0:14:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Be awfully snooty so\Nnami was a guy all along
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.34,0:14:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,no wonder she acts so\Nmanly i swear she treats me
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.90,0:14:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,like some sort of beast\Nhey nami he got up to us
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.82,0:14:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,all right then lola this\Nis your chance to attack
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,i'll never see him again\Nand that's perfectly fine
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.86,0:14:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,with me there's nothing\Nstopping you you'll make a
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful couple i'll give\Nit my best thank you for
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:43.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything, Nami, you gave\Nme the courage to fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.98,0:14:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.30,0:14:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.66,0:14:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you two, this is our chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.18,0:14:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,A non-violent solution, for us at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.00,0:15:01.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, Nami, that was awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.46,0:15:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not such a bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.96,0:15:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You just have to get to know her a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.74,0:15:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I know what you're thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.66,0:15:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can see it in your eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of stupid\Npirate ship doesn't have
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.22,0:15:16.92,Default,,0,0,0,,any treasure they have\Na few chests and such.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But all of them are empty we did pick up\Nsome money they had lying around at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.48,0:15:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,What a waste of time\Ni have to look at your
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.84,0:15:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,uncute faces and there's\Nnot even treasure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.82,0:15:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought this was the\Nguy who beat crocodile
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you'd think he'd have a\Nbit more to show for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever they've got plenty of food\Nlet's take that back with us at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.36,0:15:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Aye-aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Perona!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.12,0:15:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm? Golden?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.32,0:15:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The Master is calling for a\Nmeeting with the Mysterious Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.74,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.10,0:15:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something bad happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:49.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It would appear that Straw Hat\NLuffy has just been captured.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.40,0:15:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This will be the debut of number 900.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:53.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 900?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.82,0:15:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Ab!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.38,0:16:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out here and marry me\Nright now, you big jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You turned invisible and\Nditched me again, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.96,0:16:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,This is strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.64,0:16:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,There shouldn't be any\Nplace left for them to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom, I mean, Master\NAbsalom, this is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems intruders have...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.32,0:16:25.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.16,0:16:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you see three pirates run past here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.92,0:16:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,They just disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.30,0:16:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, actually, that's the thing. Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.22,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.42,0:16:37.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you I don't like you in my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.08,0:16:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome back, Mistress Perona.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.36,0:16:42.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.27,0:16:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I need you to stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.60,0:16:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,How many times do I have to tell you that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.20,0:16:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, but just this\Nonce, there's something...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.82,0:16:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Can it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Nobody cares!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.02,0:16:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think you're being\Na bit too strict with Kumasi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.74,0:16:54.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or rather, way too strict?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.68,0:16:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my underling.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.88,0:16:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.86,0:16:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, did you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.14,0:17:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master is calling for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.92,0:17:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.32,0:17:05.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose you could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.20,0:17:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 900 is making its big debut.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.42,0:17:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Number 900?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.60,0:17:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And he must have found a powerful shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.76,0:17:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.67,0:17:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a miracle!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They haven't found us yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.22,0:17:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What were you thinking hiding in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,We were better off before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.48,0:17:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.78,0:17:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You were freaking out about that invisible
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.52,0:17:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,guy and I found something to climb inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.82,0:17:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How was I supposed to\Nknow it was a zombie, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.46,0:17:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll run away as soon as\Nwe get the chance, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.56,0:17:32.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Absalom!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.32,0:17:34.60,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.68,0:17:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something important\NI needed to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.96,0:17:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In addition to the pirates, I'm afraid\Nthat we have another unwanted guest.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.94,0:17:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Go on, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.62,0:17:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him, the humming swordsman.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.30,0:17:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,He's back?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone just fall from the sky?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.04,0:17:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, is that what I\Nthink it is down there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.48,0:18:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, looking at the shape, I\Ndon't think it could be anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.00,0:18:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.00,0:18:17.83,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.76,0:18:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.26,0:18:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, ha, ha!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.88,0:18:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I'm gonna let you get away just\Nbecause you broke some measly bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.44,0:18:28.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.80,0:18:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can climb wherever the hell I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.74,0:18:32.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Monkey, monkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.02,0:18:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you can keep\Nthe spider busy for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.80,0:18:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What for?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.89,0:18:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There's an open section right over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.18,0:18:42.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'm going to\Nbuild a spider smasher.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.68,0:18:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticky spider net!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.80,0:18:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,He has a spinneret on his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.40,0:18:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Time for Zeus fleurs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.02,0:18:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Slap.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.00,0:19:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You slap my eye, you awful woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.54,0:19:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,No no!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.56,0:19:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're playing dirty!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.10,0:19:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Good work, partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready to rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.90,0:19:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.14,0:19:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My what's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.74,0:19:18.92,Default,,0,0,0,,This here, I just stuck my steel nunchucks\Ninto some stone columns! That's all!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.00,0:19:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Because when a monster is\Nthis big, you gotta smash him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Extra high!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.68,0:19:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Heavy induction!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:36.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did all that power come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.58,0:19:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way this guy is human!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I said stop it already! Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.86,0:19:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Sticky spider-nets!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah! Ah! Ah! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.38,0:20:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like it's time for ribbons! Nuffins!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.12,0:20:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.14,0:20:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Nico Robin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.50,0:20:22.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are those things?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.66,0:20:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mousey, mousey, mouse, mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.82,0:20:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Mousey, mousey, mouse, mouse!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.92,0:20:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was careless. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't think there'd\Nbe other spiders here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.90,0:20:41.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.46,0:20:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Serves you right, Tramonkey, Tramonkey!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.54,0:20:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what happens when\Nyou let your guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are my minions.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.66,0:20:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They're called spider mice.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more than 500 of\Nthem here on Thriller Bark.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.18,0:21:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we set our eyes on\Nyou, there's no escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.38,0:21:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,We've never once failed\Nto capture our prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.16,0:21:13.64,Default,,0,0,0,,From the shadows, from your blind spot,\Nfrom where you least expect it, we attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.20,0:21:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,And thanks to Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunkback's modifications; our\Nsilk webs are unbreakable.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.24,0:21:21.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We picked off your friends one by one,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.56,0:21:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,silently carrying them\Nthrough the ceiling of the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.76,0:21:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,mansion without anyone\Nnoticing a single thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.34,0:21:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:30.56,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as we carry you\Noff, you'll all be reunited.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.64,0:21:32.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hope you enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.12,0:21:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.03,0:21:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell is singing that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.04,0:21:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Gather up all of the crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.00,0:21:54.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time to ship out Binx's brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.04,0:21:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sea wind blows to where?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.46,0:22:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who knows the waves will be our guide?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.94,0:22:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Or across the ocean's tide?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.38,0:22:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Rays of sunshine far and wide.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.50,0:22:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Birds they sing of cheerful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.54,0:22:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,In circles, passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.12,0:22:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness, it looks like you\Ncame to this island after all?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.12,0:22:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you get all the way up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:23.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I jumped, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.80,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm quite light.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.14,0:22:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Since you're here already, I suppose\Nthere's no point in holding back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.80,0:22:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, I'll tell you everything\NI know about this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.90,0:22:33.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.88,0:22:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not a zombie? Does that\Nmean you're with these pirates?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.32,0:22:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.04,0:22:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Worry not, my friend,\NI'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put an end to this promptly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.10,0:22:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three verse humming
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.48,0:22:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Arrow not slash
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.04,0:23:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
